 "doc_revision": "Huawei 'Solar Inverter Modbus Interface Definitions', Issue 05 (2023-02-16). Community-forum mirror of the Huawei PDF; not downloaded from Huawei's own site.",
 "notes": "Built from section 3.1 'Inverter Equipment Register' of the document above (PDF text extracted locally; the table layout in the text is jumbled, rows were reconstructed by order of address, gain and quantity). NOT verified on a physical inverter. Addressing: the document prints register addresses that are used as-is in the frame (example in 6.3.4.4: register address 40200 = 0x9D08; read example register 32306 = 0x7E32), so address_base is 0 and 'address' is the printed number. Only function codes 03, 06 and 10 hex are supported (document table 6-3). Scaling: 'Gain' in the document means the register holds value * gain; scale = 1/gain (gain 10 -> 0.1, 100 -> 0.01, 1000 -> 0.001). Word order for 32-bit values is NOT explicitly stated in the parts read; standard Modbus high word first ('big') is assumed. Connection per document: Modbus-RTU (RS485/MBUS) slave addresses 1-247 (0 broadcast, 248-255 reserved); Modbus-TCP port 6607 and logical device ID (unit) 0 by default for the directly connected device. Serial baud rate/parity defaults are NOT given in the document, so only the TCP defaults are in 'connection'. Maximum 24 PV strings: PVn voltage = register 32014+2n, PVn current = 32015+2n (only PV1-PV4 included; the Number of PV strings register tells how many are valid). Not included: string/ASCII registers (Model 30000, SN 30015, PN 30025 etc.; the preset schema has no string type), battery (LUNA2000) and meter registers, optimizer interfaces, and all writable/command registers (Startup 40200 and Shutdown 40201 are write-only 'WO' in the document, active/reactive power scheduling 40120/40125 etc. are RW) - these command real equipment and the preset schema cannot express write-only registers, so they are deliberately omitted. Some 4G/Smart I-V curve registers exist in the document but are omitted. Unit for insulation resistance printed as 'M' (assumed MOhm). Registers 47416/47418 mentioned by third parties as undocumented are not used.",
